# SmartHub — indeks
Domain    : smarthub.logikraf.id (Cloudflare DNS -> 103.197.188.248, cert LetsEncrypt ok)
Repo      : ~/Projects/Smarthub (github nvnrchmn/Smarthub) — menggantikan smarthub-v3 yang dihapus
Stack     : pnpm monorepo — apps/api (Express 5 + Prisma, tsup ESM), apps/web (Next.js 15 standalone)
Database  : PostgreSQL 16, db/user `smarthub`, 41 tabel (nama tabel & kolom bahasa Indonesia)
Layanan   : smarthub-api.service :4000 | smarthub-web.service :3000 | postgresql | nginx
Deploy    : build-lokal.sh smarthub [build|rilis] — config /etc/build-lokal.d/smarthub.conf
Webroot   : /www/wwwroot/smarthub.logikraf.id/web = .next/standalone + .next/static + public
Env       : /www/wwwroot/smarthub.logikraf.id/.env (EnvironmentFile kedua unit)
Vhost     : /www/server/panel/vhost/nginx/smarthub.logikraf.id.conf (80->301 ; 443 ; /api/ -> 4000)
Login     : tenant   POST /api/v1/auth/login       {identifier, password}
            platform POST /api/v1/admin/auth/login {email, password}
PENTING   : API dijalankan LANGSUNG dari repo (ExecStart apps/api/dist/server.js), bukan dari copy.
            Menyalin node_modules ke webroot GAGAL — Prisma client hidup di pnpm store,
            error: Named export 'Prisma' not found (bundle ESM impor modul CJS).

